flowchart LR
  User[Authorized network staff] -->|Authenticated browser session| FredUI[Fred Network Tools]
  FredUI -->|GET registered drivers| FredAPI[Fred API on Linux<br/>role gate]
  FredUI -->|POST name, RFC1918 IPv4,<br/>exact driver, location, comment| FredAPI

  subgraph Azure[Azure application boundary]
    FredAPI
  end

  FredAPI -->|Private HTTP to 10.0.0.30:9124<br/>Bearer service token| Firewall[Windows Firewall<br/>Fred 10.0.0.44 plus local self-test]
  Firewall --> Bridge[Restricted Windows print bridge<br/>PRNTSP2]

  subgraph Campus[Private campus boundary]
    Bridge -->|Get-PrinterDriver| Drivers[(Registered drivers)]
    Bridge -->|Bounded TCP/9100 check| Device[Printer IPv4 address]
    Bridge -->|Add-PrinterPort without -SNMP<br/>Add-Printer or Set-Printer| Queue[(Shared queue on prntsp2)]
  end

  Drivers -->|Exact driver list| Bridge
  Queue -->|Verified queue and UNC path| Bridge
  Bridge -->|Structured verification or phase error| FredAPI
  FredAPI -->|Success or actionable failure| FredUI

  Missing[Missing driver package] -.->|Installed separately by an administrator| Drivers
